          "en": "3. Enclosed documents:\n- Original of the Plan (2) ................................................\n- Other documents (if any) ..................................................\n........., day .... month .... year .........\nFOREST OWNER\n(Sign, state full name, and affix seal for organisations)\nNote:\n(*) This form shall be made by the forest owner, the\nowner of forest products, the project owner or the\norganisation or individual assigned by the competent authority (abbreviated as the forest owner) when requesting\nthe competent authority to approve the plan for harvesting timber and non-timber forest plants of ordinary\nspecies/ordinary forest animals from the wild/collection of specimens of ordinary forest plant species.\n(1) Name of the forest owner and document number if it is an organisation.\n(2) Record one of the specific harvesting cases in accordance with the\nprovisions of clause 2 of Article 6 or clause 1 of Article 7 of this Circular.\n(3) Record clearly the name of the agency with competence to approve the harvesting\nplan in accordance with the provisions of clause 3 of Article 6 of this Circular.\n(4) Record the name in Vietnamese or the trading name in English\n(if any) for organisations, or the full name for individuals.\n(5) Record the number of the investment registration certificate/enterprise code/establishment licence/operation\nregistration for organisations; the number of the citizen identity card/identity card/passport for individuals.\n(6) Record clearly the address on the investment or enterprise\nregistration certificate or the establishment or operation registration\nlicence for organisations; and the permanent address on the\nidentity card or citizen identity card or passport for individuals.\nForm No. 10: Record of field inspection to identify forest trees to be cut or pruned or\nlowered in the safety protection corridor of high-voltage overhead power transmission lines\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF VIETNAM\nIndependence - Freedom - Happiness\n---------------\n.........., day ......... month ......... year .........\nRECORD\nField inspection to identify forest trees to be cut or pruned or lowered in\nthe safety protection corridor of high-voltage overhead power transmission lines\nPursuant to Decree No. 156/2018/ND-CP dated 16/11/2018 of the Government detailing the\nimplementation of a number of articles of the Law on Forestry, as amended and supplemented in 2024;\nPursuant to Decree No. 62/2025/ND-CP dated 04/3/2025 of the Government detailing the implementation\nof the Law on Electricity on protection of power\nworks and safety in the field of electricity;\nPursuant to document No. .... dated .... month .... year .... of the Organisation.... (name of\nthe organisation managing the power line) requesting a field inspection to identify forest trees\nto be cut or pruned or lowered in the safety protection corridor of high-voltage overhead power\ntransmission lines (hereinafter abbreviated as the safety protection corridor of the power line).\nToday, on .... month .... year .... at: lot ....... compartment .... sub-zone .... forest area\n.... belonging to hamlet .... commune/ward ..... province .....................................\nWe comprise:\nI. COMPOSITION\n1. Representative of the organisation or agency managing the power line:\n- Mr (Mrs) ..................................; position: ........................\n- Mr (Mrs) ................................; position: ..........................\n2. Representative of the forest owner or owner of forest products:\n- Mr (Mrs) .....................................................................\n- Mr (Mrs) .....................................................................\n3. Representative of the local Forest Protection agency:\n- Mr (Mrs): ........................, position: ................................\n- Mr (Mrs): ........................, position: ................................"
