          "en": "4. Other relevant agencies or units (if any):\n- Mr (Mrs) .....................................................................\n- Mr (Mrs) .....................................................................\nII. CONTENTS\nA record of field inspection to identify forest\ntrees to be cut or pruned or lowered in the\nsafety protection corridor of the power line shall be made, comprising the following main contents:\n- Type of forest: special-use forest, protection forest, production forest\n- Origin: natural forest, planted forest\n- Tree species (for planted forests): ...................... year of planting: ..................\n- Number of forest trees to be cut or pruned or lowered\nin the safety protection corridor of the power line: .....\ntrees (statistics of the number of trees by lot, compartment,\nsub-zone and commune); tree species (for planted forests).\nIII. CONCLUSION AND RECOMMENDATIONS\n...........................................................................\n...........................................................................\n...........................................................................\n...........................................................................\n...........................................................................\nThe record comprises .... pages; made in .... copies, agreed by the participating members without other\nopinions, and the field inspection ended at .....\nhours ..... minutes on .... month ..... year ...../.\nTHE MEMBERS OF THE FIELD INSPECTION DELEGATION SHALL SIGN\nFOREST OWNER/OWNER OF FOREST PRODUCTS\n(sign, state full name, affix seal if an organisation)\nORGANISATION OR AGENCY MANAGING THE POWER LINE\n(sign, state full name, affix seal)\nREPRESENTATIVE OF THE LOCAL FOREST PROTECTION AGENCY\n(sign, state full name, affix seal)\nForm No. 11: Decision approving the plan for harvesting timber and non-timber forest\nplants of ordinary species/collection of specimens of ordinary forest plant species\nAGENCY (1) .....\n-------\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF VIETNAM\nIndependence - Freedom - Happiness\n---------------\nNo.: ..../QD-.... ......, day .... month .... year ....\nDECISION\nOn approval of the harvesting plan (2) ....\nCOMPETENCE OF THE SIGNATORY\nPursuant to(3) .......................................................................;\nPursuant to the Law on Forestry dated 15 November 2017;\nPursuant to Decree No. 156/2018/ND-CP dated 16 November 2018 of the Government detailing the\nimplementation of a number of articles of the Law\non Forestry, as amended and supplemented in 2024;\nPursuant to Decree No. 140/2024/ND-CP dated 25 October 2024 of the Government on liquidation of planted\nforests (if salvage harvesting of planted forests is\ncarried out on areas of forest already liquidated);\nPursuant to Decision No. ...... (decisions approving sustainable forest management plans, if any) .......;\nPursuant to .................................................................................................;\nConsidering the request of ..............................................................................\nDECIDES:\nArticle 1. To approve the plan for principal/salvage/final harvesting of timber and non-timber forest plants/collection\nof specimens of ordinary species of ....... (name of organisation\nor individual) ....... with the following main contents:\n1. Place of harvesting (lot, compartment, sub-zone, commune...)(4): ........................"
